nd":"save"},{"minute":"103","text":"토티가 두 번째 경고로 퇴장합니다. 판정을 둘러싼 논쟁이 이어집니다.","kind":"red"}]},{"id":"euro-final","date":"2016-07-10","home":"Portugal","away":"France","competition":"UEFA EURO 결승","title":"생드니, 두 나라의 마지막 밤","venue":"스타드 드 프랑스","source":"https://www.uefa.com/uefaeuro/history/news/0253-0d81c3763c88-e741506b5589-1000--portugal-spoil-france-s-party-with-extra-time-win/","goals":[{"minute":"109","team":"Portugal","scorer":"에데르","penalty":false,"own":false}],"hg":1,"ag":0,"duration":120,"notes":[{"minute":"25","text":"부상당한 호날두가 콰레스마와 교체됩니다. 주장이 그라운드를 떠납니다.","kind":"sub"}]},{"id":"mexico","date":"1986-06-22","home":"Argentina","away":"England","competition":"월드컵 8강","title":"아스테카, 세계의 시선","venue":"에스타디오 아스테카","source":"https://www.fifa.com/en/tournaments/mens/worldcup/articles/argentina-england-1986-diego-maradona","goals":[{"minute":"51","team":"Argentina","scorer":"디에고 마라도나","penalty":false,"own":false},{"minute":"55","team":"Argentina","scorer":"디에고 마라도나","penalty":false,"own":false},{"minute":"81","team":"England","scorer":"게리 리네커","penalty":false,"own":false}],"hg":2,"ag":1,"notes":[{"minute":"51","text":"첫 득점은 손을 사용한 장면입니다. 당시 심판은 득점을 인정했습니다.","kind":"controversy"}]},{"date":"2022-12-18","home":"Argentina","away":"France","hg":3,"ag":3,"stage":"Final","group":"","venue":"Lusail Iconic Stadium, Lusail","pens":[4,2],"goals":[{"minute":"23","team":"Argentina","scorer":"Lionel Messi","penalty":true,"own":false},{"minute":"36","team":"Argentina","scorer":"Ángel Di María","penalty":false,"own":false},{"minute":"108","team":"Argentina","scorer":"Lionel Messi","penalty":false,"own":false},{"minute":"80","team":"France","scorer":"Kylian Mbappé","penalty":true,"own":false},{"minute":"81","team":"France","scorer":"Kylian Mbappé","penalty":false,"own":false},{"minute":"118","team":"France","scorer":"Kylian Mbappé","penalty":true,"own":false}],"shootoutWinner":"Argentina","id":"lusail","competition":"월드컵 결승","title":"루사일, 마지막 트로피를 향해","source":"https://github.com/op